OL,3,GNEWSADealer jailed for exploiting
OL,4,A14-year-old boy into selling drugs for
OL,5,Ahim
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drug dealer has been jailed for six
OL,8,Fyears and nine months after he admitted
OL,9,Fexploiting a schoolboy to sell drugs
OL,10,Ffor him in one of the first convictions
OL,11,Fof its kind in Scotland.
OL,13,FMatteullah Siddiqi, 20, preyed on the
OL,14,F14-year-old after having initially met
OL,15,Fhim at a games arcade in Glasgow city
OL,16,Fcentre last year.
OL,18,FThe teenager was forced to skip school
OL,19,Fand stay in drug dens, and was only
OL,20,Frescued when teachers became concerned
OL,21,Fand he admitted what he had been doing.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
