OL,3,GNEWSADealer jailed for exploiting
OL,4,A14-year-old boy into selling drugs for
OL,5,Ahim
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the High Court in Glasgow the judge
OL,8,Ftold Siddiqi that the boy had described
OL,9,Fwhat happened to him as "mentally
OL,10,Ftraumatic and distressing for his
OL,11,Ffamily".
